								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=792"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=823.msg10621#msg10621"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=823.msg10621#msg10621">Re: Is this Shit Really Happening? (WARNING GRAPHIC IMAGES)</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #6 on:</b> August 30, 2004, 10:22:55 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I know this is an old thread but my comment on seeing the Nick Berg video gave me nightmares for weeks. I have a strong stomach but it has its limits.&nbsp; That is why we need to be in Iraq to follow through what we attended to do in Iraq. If Kerry gets elected he will pull our forces out in 6mo and the world wont take us seriously.&nbsp; No matter what the issue this young man didnt have to go through that and then his parents witness this. ITS HORRIBLE.. Anyone who has a son or daughter will understand this.&nbsp; My blessings and my prayers go out to the Berg family and all the people that are contributing in Iraq.<br /><br /><br />Colleen Quickness<br />65 Ranger
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
